1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:04,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>BEYOND JOURNEY'S END</b></font>

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:07,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

3
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:32,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>EPISODE 32: OTHER PEOPLE'S HOMES</b></font>

4
00:01:32,930 --> 00:01:34,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

5
00:01:38,810 --> 00:01:39,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

6
00:01:39,980 --> 00:01:41,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern groans]</b></font>

7
00:01:46,690 --> 00:01:48,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mistress Frieren,</b></font>

8
00:01:48,230 --> 00:01:50,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>which do you think
would be better?</b></font>

9
00:01:50,740 --> 00:01:52,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A dress is a dress, isn't it?</b></font>

10
00:01:52,990 --> 00:01:54,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And before you run off today,</b></font>

11
00:01:54,570 --> 00:01:56,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need you to tie up my hair.</b></font>

12
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:02,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren grunts, groans]</b></font>

13
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:04,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] This is torturous.</b></font>

14
00:02:04,630 --> 00:02:07,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can apologize,
if that's what it will take</b></font>

15
00:02:07,090 --> 00:02:10,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to stop you from braiding
so vengefully.</b></font>

16
00:02:10,090 --> 00:02:11,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

17
00:02:31,900 --> 00:02:33,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you're so desperate
for my attention,</b></font>

18
00:02:33,900 --> 00:02:35,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>how about you and I
go on a date?</b></font>

19
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:39,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[footsteps approaching]
-[Stark gasps softly]</b></font>

20
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:51,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You ready to go?</b></font>

21
00:02:53,380 --> 00:02:54,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes.</b></font>

22
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

23
00:03:04,310 --> 00:03:06,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're not wearing
your usual outfit today.</b></font>

24
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:07,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why's that?</b></font>

25
00:03:07,690 --> 00:03:08,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Uh?</b></font>

26
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:12,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because... this is a date.</b></font>

27
00:03:12,610 --> 00:03:13,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Mmm.</b></font>

28
00:03:13,990 --> 00:03:15,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fair enough.</b></font>

29
00:03:15,530 --> 00:03:16,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

30
00:03:17,820 --> 00:03:19,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WOMAN] I don't buy it!</b></font>

31
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:21,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-It's the truth!
-You're kidding!</b></font>

32
00:03:21,330 --> 00:03:22,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[woman laughs]</b></font>

33
00:03:22,620 --> 00:03:23,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

34
00:03:31,210 --> 00:03:32,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Huh?</b></font>

35
00:03:32,380 --> 00:03:35,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Has Fern been this cute
the entire time?</b></font>

36
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:39,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, you ready for some fun?</b></font>

37
00:03:39,470 --> 00:03:43,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mr. Stark, you seem
stiffer than normal.</b></font>

38
00:03:43,180 --> 00:03:45,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nope, no stiffness here.</b></font>

39
00:03:48,770 --> 00:03:49,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hm?</b></font>

40
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why did you stop?</b></font>

41
00:03:53,230 --> 00:03:55,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just tell me,
where are we going?</b></font>

42
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's a marketplace up ahead</b></font>

43
00:03:57,530 --> 00:03:59,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that I thought
we could check out.</b></font>

44
00:04:04,490 --> 00:04:05,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A marketplace?</b></font>

45
00:04:05,950 --> 00:04:08,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where Mistress Frieren
has been shopping?</b></font>

46
00:04:08,870 --> 00:04:12,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, because
we're in a bigger city,</b></font>

47
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:15,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>she says there are loads
of rare magical items to find.</b></font>

48
00:04:15,130 --> 00:04:16,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren chuckles]</b></font>

49
00:04:17,590 --> 00:04:19,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wow, how useful.</b></font>

50
00:04:20,970 --> 00:04:23,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] That explains
the mountain of curiosities</b></font>

51
00:04:23,060 --> 00:04:24,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>piling up at the inn.</b></font>

52
00:04:24,890 --> 00:04:26,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>More?</b></font>

53
00:04:26,730 --> 00:04:29,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Be careful not to get caught
in an avalanche.</b></font>

54
00:04:29,190 --> 00:04:32,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The other day, I found her
passed out under the junk.</b></font>

55
00:04:32,110 --> 00:04:33,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Frieren snores]
-[FERN] Uh?</b></font>

56
00:04:33,980 --> 00:04:36,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Take a passion too far
and it gets scary.</b></font>

57
00:04:36,150 --> 00:04:37,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] It was.</b></font>

58
00:04:37,950 --> 00:04:39,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Speaking of her passions,</b></font>

59
00:04:39,570 --> 00:04:41,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I bet she's already back
at the hot springs.</b></font>

60
00:04:42,490 --> 00:04:43,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I appreciate a good soak,</b></font>

61
00:04:43,950 --> 00:04:45,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but she must be
tired of it by now.</b></font>

62
00:04:45,950 --> 00:04:47,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know I'd be.</b></font>

63
00:04:47,330 --> 00:04:48,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I were her,</b></font>

64
00:04:48,460 --> 00:04:50,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd need to
change it up a little bit.</b></font>

65
00:04:50,830 --> 00:04:53,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Today, she did. Because of me,</b></font>

66
00:04:53,090 --> 00:04:55,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>she's sporting a new hairstyle.</b></font>

67
00:04:55,590 --> 00:04:57,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren sighs]</b></font>

68
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How divine.</b></font>

69
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:01,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your usual updo is cute enough,</b></font>

70
00:05:01,380 --> 00:05:03,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but those braids are precious!</b></font>

71
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

72
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:08,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whenever we're alone,</b></font>

73
00:05:08,390 --> 00:05:10,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we end up talking about
Mistress Frieren.</b></font>

74
00:05:11,230 --> 00:05:14,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, it's not like there's
much else to discuss.</b></font>

75
00:05:18,940 --> 00:05:21,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FEMALE SHOPKEEP] Take a look!
I'll give you a discount.</b></font>

76
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Do you want
to get something to eat?</b></font>

77
00:05:24,370 --> 00:05:26,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, thank you. Not yet.</b></font>

78
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay, then.</b></font>

79
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

80
00:05:41,050 --> 00:05:42,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Pretty.</b></font>

81
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:46,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Apparently,
couples get a discount.</b></font>

82
00:05:47,140 --> 00:05:49,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guess dating's worth it
for the deals alone.</b></font>

83
00:05:50,310 --> 00:05:52,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're awfully blunt, Mr. Stark.</b></font>

84
00:05:52,940 --> 00:05:54,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

85
00:05:56,230 --> 00:05:59,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This stuff doesn't look
particularly magical or rare.</b></font>

86
00:05:59,570 --> 00:06:02,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>These shops cater
to all sorts of people.</b></font>

87
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:03,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not just mages.</b></font>

88
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:05,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
Yeah, that's a good point.</b></font>

89
00:06:06,410 --> 00:06:07,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This city is enormous.</b></font>

90
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's see what else
there is to see.</b></font>

91
00:06:13,620 --> 00:06:15,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[WOMAN] It's beautiful!
-[MAN] Very.</b></font>

92
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:18,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'd like to buy
this one, ma'am.</b></font>

93
00:06:18,170 --> 00:06:20,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes, of course! Sure thing.</b></font>

94
00:06:21,090 --> 00:06:22,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

95
00:06:22,170 --> 00:06:24,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've gotta be hungry
by now, right?</b></font>

96
00:06:24,130 --> 00:06:25,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The snacks
at the stalls up ahead</b></font>

97
00:06:25,930 --> 00:06:27,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>smell delicious.</b></font>

98
00:06:30,930 --> 00:06:34,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MALE SHOPKEEP] Enjoy!
-Whoa, these look amazing!</b></font>

99
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:36,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Let's go find a table.
-Sure.</b></font>

100
00:06:40,230 --> 00:06:41,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern grunts]</b></font>

101
00:06:42,440 --> 00:06:43,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Got you!</b></font>

102
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you okay?</b></font>

103
00:06:47,780 --> 00:06:50,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[exclaims softly] I'm sorry.</b></font>

104
00:06:50,330 --> 00:06:51,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hmm...</b></font>

105
00:06:51,870 --> 00:06:53,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Those shoes
look hard to walk in.</b></font>

106
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:55,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One slip and you're down.</b></font>

107
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:08,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

108
00:07:34,870 --> 00:07:36,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yet another Mr. Himmel.</b></font>

109
00:07:36,830 --> 00:07:38,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's like he follows us.</b></font>

110
00:07:38,460 --> 00:07:41,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I gotta say, he really nailed
the pose in this city.</b></font>

111
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I agree.</b></font>

112
00:07:43,210 --> 00:07:44,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] According to Frieren,</b></font>

113
00:07:44,550 --> 00:07:46,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there are over
100 different poses</b></font>

114
00:07:46,170 --> 00:07:47,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>floating around out there.</b></font>

115
00:07:48,430 --> 00:07:50,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Sounds like they went
a little overboard.</b></font>

116
00:07:50,550 --> 00:07:52,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Seriously.</b></font>

117
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:56,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>An entire day,</b></font>

118
00:07:56,230 --> 00:07:59,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and we're still talking about
Mistress Frieren.</b></font>

119
00:08:03,070 --> 00:08:06,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Anyway, this place
is nice and quiet.</b></font>

120
00:08:06,570 --> 00:08:08,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the view is very pretty.</b></font>

121
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] For sure.</b></font>

122
00:08:14,370 --> 00:08:15,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey, Fern,</b></font>

123
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:18,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if you had a bad time today,
you can just say so.</b></font>

124
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] I wouldn't say "bad."</b></font>

125
00:08:23,210 --> 00:08:26,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I haven't seen you smile
a single time.</b></font>

126
00:08:29,510 --> 00:08:30,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] I don't know.</b></font>

127
00:08:30,970 --> 00:08:33,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I really did like
all the places we visited.</b></font>

128
00:08:33,970 --> 00:08:36,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But for some reason...</b></font>

129
00:08:37,930 --> 00:08:40,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they didn't feel like
places you'd choose.</b></font>

130
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And now our date has come
and gone.</b></font>

131
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:48,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry, Fern.</b></font>

132
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:53,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I actually had Frieren pick out
all the places we stopped.</b></font>

133
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:56,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And why would you do that?</b></font>

134
00:08:58,370 --> 00:09:01,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanted you to enjoy it
and I felt clueless on my own.</b></font>

135
00:09:02,540 --> 00:09:05,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's our first date.
It's special.</b></font>

136
00:09:08,050 --> 00:09:09,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I understand.</b></font>

137
00:09:10,510 --> 00:09:12,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm a little sad
our date didn't feel</b></font>

138
00:09:13,010 --> 00:09:14,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>how I thought it would.</b></font>

139
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:15,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But...</b></font>

140
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

141
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:19,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm also happy.</b></font>

142
00:09:19,980 --> 00:09:21,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You worked so hard.</b></font>

143
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:23,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you
for putting in that effort.</b></font>

144
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:25,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course.</b></font>

145
00:09:25,980 --> 00:09:27,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

146
00:09:31,030 --> 00:09:33,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This moment
is perfectly peaceful.</b></font>

147
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:37,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How funny. Look at that cloud.</b></font>

148
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:41,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles] It's one of the
pork buns we ate earlier.</b></font>

149
00:09:41,660 --> 00:09:43,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was thinking the same thing!</b></font>

150
00:09:44,460 --> 00:09:46,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both laugh]</b></font>

151
00:09:50,510 --> 00:09:52,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I feel so calm.</b></font>

152
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:55,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When my parents passed,
I never imagined</b></font>

153
00:09:55,890 --> 00:09:58,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I would experience peace
like this again.</b></font>

154
00:09:58,640 --> 00:10:00,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I get that.</b></font>

155
00:10:00,730 --> 00:10:02,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's all thanks
to Master Heiter.</b></font>

156
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:06,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I could say the same thing
about my master.</b></font>

157
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

158
00:10:15,870 --> 00:10:16,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark groans softly]</b></font>

159
00:10:17,030 --> 00:10:18,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN]
Picky eaters do not make</b></font>

160
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:21,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for strong warriors, young man.</b></font>

161
00:10:31,630 --> 00:10:32,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have a question.</b></font>

162
00:10:33,470 --> 00:10:34,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] What's that?</b></font>

163
00:10:35,340 --> 00:10:37,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why did you take in
somebody like me?</b></font>

164
00:10:37,970 --> 00:10:39,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

165
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:42,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] Because it's what
Himmel the Hero would've done.</b></font>

166
00:10:42,730 --> 00:10:43,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

167
00:10:53,190 --> 00:10:55,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You seem to be
in a good mood this evening.</b></font>

168
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>For a good reason?</b></font>

169
00:10:59,530 --> 00:11:00,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not really.</b></font>

170
00:11:04,750 --> 00:11:05,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

171
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:07,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL]
The final stop on our list...</b></font>

172
00:11:08,420 --> 00:11:09,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And no luck.</b></font>

173
00:11:10,300 --> 00:11:12,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've officially searched
every nook and cranny</b></font>

174
00:11:12,510 --> 00:11:14,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that the shopkeeper gave us.</b></font>

175
00:11:15,550 --> 00:11:16,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're hopeless.</b></font>

176
00:11:16,970 --> 00:11:18,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So why is it you smile?</b></font>

177
00:11:18,470 --> 00:11:19,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Himmel chuckles]</b></font>

178
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:23,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] I suppose
I'm just in a good mood.</b></font>

179
00:11:23,770 --> 00:11:25,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because today was a good day.</b></font>

180
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How can you
call the day good</b></font>

181
00:11:28,060 --> 00:11:30,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when we spent it all trolling
the streets for a lost cat?</b></font>

182
00:11:31,070 --> 00:11:32,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Simple.</b></font>

183
00:11:32,730 --> 00:11:35,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because I spent it all trolling
the streets with you, Frieren.</b></font>

184
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was fun.</b></font>

185
00:11:36,990 --> 00:11:39,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Despite us never finding
the cat?</b></font>

186
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Himmel gasps]</b></font>

187
00:11:41,030 --> 00:11:42,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if things don't go
the way you'd hoped,</b></font>

188
00:11:42,990 --> 00:11:45,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there's still joy to be found
on the journey.</b></font>

189
00:11:45,750 --> 00:11:47,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Today brought much joy.</b></font>

190
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:49,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Certainly enough
to put a smile on my face.</b></font>

191
00:11:50,170 --> 00:11:51,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Mm...</b></font>

192
00:11:52,590 --> 00:11:53,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] All right.</b></font>

193
00:11:54,010 --> 00:11:56,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We don't want Heiter and Eisen
beating us to it.</b></font>

194
00:11:56,470 --> 00:11:58,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So let the journey continue.
-[cat meows]</b></font>

195
00:11:58,760 --> 00:12:00,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[both gasp]</b></font>

196
00:12:00,890 --> 00:12:02,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasping]</b></font>

197
00:12:02,220 --> 00:12:04,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Himmel gasps]
-[FRIEREN] That must be our cat.</b></font>

198
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:07,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] Perfect timing, kitty.
Let's catch it!</b></font>

199
00:12:07,190 --> 00:12:08,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

200
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:18,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You did your hair
all fancy again.</b></font>

201
00:12:18,950 --> 00:12:20,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>These are the braids
that I receive</b></font>

202
00:12:20,820 --> 00:12:23,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when my stylist
is in a good mood.</b></font>

203
00:12:23,580 --> 00:12:25,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't tell the difference.</b></font>

204
00:12:25,500 --> 00:12:28,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] It's woven
into their very essence.</b></font>

205
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:30,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] You people expect
too much outta me.</b></font>

206
00:12:31,830 --> 00:12:33,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>29 YEARS AFTER THE DEATH
OF HIMMEL THE HERO,</b></font>

207
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:35,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IN THE NACHRICHT REGION,
LOCATED IN THE NORTHERN LANDS</b></font>

208
00:12:36,210 --> 00:12:38,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's gotten a little chillier,
hasn't it?</b></font>

209
00:12:38,590 --> 00:12:40,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We are out
of the volcanic area now.</b></font>

210
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:44,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should be able
to see it at any moment.</b></font>

211
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:45,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

212
00:12:46,430 --> 00:12:49,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Is that the
Northern Plateau checkpoint?</b></font>

213
00:12:49,100 --> 00:12:51,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Could they have made it
more intimidating?</b></font>

214
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:54,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait until you see the beasts
that lie on the other side.</b></font>

215
00:12:54,610 --> 00:12:55,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

216
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:03,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It'll be a long while</b></font>

217
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:05,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before we have access
to supplies again.</b></font>

218
00:13:05,370 --> 00:13:07,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let's get everything
we need while we can.</b></font>

219
00:13:07,620 --> 00:13:08,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOTH] Hm.</b></font>

220
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:10,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

221
00:13:19,670 --> 00:13:21,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You could put a whole market
in that suitcase</b></font>

222
00:13:21,550 --> 00:13:23,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and there'd still be room.</b></font>

223
00:13:23,220 --> 00:13:24,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nifty, eh?</b></font>

224
00:13:29,770 --> 00:13:31,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark gasps]</b></font>

225
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:32,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh?</b></font>

226
00:13:38,820 --> 00:13:39,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[guard gasps softly]</b></font>

227
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fern, the first-class mage.</b></font>

228
00:13:41,820 --> 00:13:42,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right this way, Miss.</b></font>

229
00:13:43,450 --> 00:13:44,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You take care.</b></font>

230
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:51,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I forget she's a big deal.</b></font>

231
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:54,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When one reaches the pinnacle
of magical prowess,</b></font>

232
00:13:54,170 --> 00:13:56,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you might want
to make a mental note.</b></font>

233
00:14:01,880 --> 00:14:04,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] This is the big,
bad Northern Plateau?</b></font>

234
00:14:05,260 --> 00:14:06,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>From what I've heard,</b></font>

235
00:14:06,350 --> 00:14:08,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I expected blood
and guts and chaos,</b></font>

236
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:10,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>not a normal forest.</b></font>

237
00:14:10,980 --> 00:14:14,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you being serious?
Just look around.</b></font>

238
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look for what?</b></font>

239
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:19,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] We're surrounded.</b></font>

240
00:14:19,940 --> 00:14:21,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growling]</b></font>

241
00:14:21,490 --> 00:14:22,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark gasps]</b></font>

242
00:14:23,950 --> 00:14:25,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stay on your toes.</b></font>

243
00:14:26,740 --> 00:14:28,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is merely the beginning.</b></font>

244
00:14:28,490 --> 00:14:30,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[growling]
-[Stark grunting]</b></font>

245
00:14:34,830 --> 00:14:36,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growling]</b></font>

246
00:14:38,710 --> 00:14:40,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

247
00:15:13,830 --> 00:15:17,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark sighs, groans]</b></font>

248
00:15:17,830 --> 00:15:19,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] It's a village.</b></font>

249
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:23,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I thought I was gonna die
out there. [coughs]</b></font>

250
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:26,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Three days and nights of blood
and guts and chaos.</b></font>

251
00:15:27,590 --> 00:15:29,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I do hope we can rest here.</b></font>

252
00:15:31,100 --> 00:15:32,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] Fine with us.</b></font>

253
00:15:32,850 --> 00:15:34,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's an extra cabin
no one's using.</b></font>

254
00:15:35,350 --> 00:15:36,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Make yourselves at home.</b></font>

255
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:38,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[exclaims]
-Thank you, sir.</b></font>

256
00:15:39,900 --> 00:15:41,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Forgive me.</b></font>

257
00:15:41,110 --> 00:15:43,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I do not wish
to trouble you, but...</b></font>

258
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:47,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A monster took over
the road north.</b></font>

259
00:15:47,660 --> 00:15:49,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're used
to dealing with beasts,</b></font>

260
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:51,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but this one's
a different story.</b></font>

261
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:55,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] The local knights
are powerless against it.</b></font>

262
00:15:57,290 --> 00:16:00,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Traveling merchants can
no longer pass this way.</b></font>

263
00:16:00,750 --> 00:16:01,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And as you can see,</b></font>

264
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:04,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>adventurers rarely
visit this land.</b></font>

265
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:06,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In exchange for the cabin,</b></font>

266
00:16:06,470 --> 00:16:08,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>will you three please
slay the monster?</b></font>

267
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:11,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sure. We're going north anyway.</b></font>

268
00:16:11,680 --> 00:16:14,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'll slay it
on our way out of town.</b></font>

269
00:16:14,770 --> 00:16:17,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Is that all right?
-[FERN] Yes.</b></font>

270
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:21,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess we can.</b></font>

271
00:16:22,770 --> 00:16:24,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But won't another take
its place?</b></font>

272
00:16:24,820 --> 00:16:26,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The checkpoint
is only three days away</b></font>

273
00:16:26,610 --> 00:16:27,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from your village.</b></font>

274
00:16:28,860 --> 00:16:30,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know this place
is dangerous,</b></font>

275
00:16:30,410 --> 00:16:32,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so why don't you move?</b></font>

276
00:16:32,740 --> 00:16:34,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[man chuckles]</b></font>

277
00:16:34,450 --> 00:16:36,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Dangerous it is,</b></font>

278
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:38,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even for our
northern sensibilities.</b></font>

279
00:16:40,370 --> 00:16:43,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That said, this land is where
we were born and raised.</b></font>

280
00:16:47,380 --> 00:16:49,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look around.</b></font>

281
00:16:49,050 --> 00:16:52,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Every pocket of this place
sings of the past.</b></font>

282
00:16:53,050 --> 00:16:55,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And who could abandon
the home they love?</b></font>

283
00:16:58,430 --> 00:16:59,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren chuckles softly]</b></font>

284
00:17:02,100 --> 00:17:03,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Shall we be off, then?</b></font>

285
00:17:04,520 --> 00:17:06,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[goats bleating]</b></font>

286
00:17:07,990 --> 00:17:09,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We wish you well.</b></font>

287
00:17:19,460 --> 00:17:21,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[horse neighing]
-[Stark gasps]</b></font>

288
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:32,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[monster grunting]</b></font>

289
00:17:37,930 --> 00:17:40,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growling]</b></font>

290
00:17:55,910 --> 00:17:57,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A powerful beast, indeed.</b></font>

291
00:17:58,080 --> 00:18:00,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't let your guard down.</b></font>

292
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[monster growling]
-[Stark grunts]</b></font>

293
00:18:12,380 --> 00:18:13,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Too fast.</b></font>

294
00:18:23,100 --> 00:18:25,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This monster isn't
like the others.</b></font>

295
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:28,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] We've found ourselves
a formidable foe.</b></font>

296
00:18:36,820 --> 00:18:37,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[monster growling]</b></font>

297
00:18:42,290 --> 00:18:45,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] The methods we've used
thus far aren't going to work.</b></font>

298
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:47,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Certainly seems that way.</b></font>

299
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:49,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fine.</b></font>

300
00:18:52,630 --> 00:18:53,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern gasps]</b></font>

301
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:55,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[monster growling]
-[Fern grunts]</b></font>

302
00:18:55,970 --> 00:18:57,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark gasps]</b></font>

303
00:18:59,430 --> 00:19:01,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[monster growling]</b></font>

304
00:19:09,190 --> 00:19:10,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[monster grunts]</b></font>

305
00:19:16,570 --> 00:19:18,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Quite the eye on this one.</b></font>

306
00:19:18,490 --> 00:19:19,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[growls]</b></font>

307
00:19:23,080 --> 00:19:25,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, Stark,
while it's looking here.</b></font>

308
00:19:25,330 --> 00:19:26,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Already on it!</b></font>

309
00:19:29,790 --> 00:19:31,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunts]</b></font>

310
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:39,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sure, it's tough.</b></font>

311
00:19:39,970 --> 00:19:41,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I'm right there with it!</b></font>

312
00:19:42,100 --> 00:19:46,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I won't let it beat me!
Frieren!</b></font>

313
00:20:02,330 --> 00:20:03,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark gasps softly]</b></font>

314
00:20:06,250 --> 00:20:07,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark gasps softly]</b></font>

315
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:14,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] That thing was a force
to be reckoned with.</b></font>

316
00:20:15,380 --> 00:20:18,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] We've only just
entered the Northern Plateau.</b></font>

317
00:20:18,380 --> 00:20:20,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That monster's strength
wasn't unique.</b></font>

318
00:20:20,300 --> 00:20:23,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You should prepare for
similar battles down the line.</b></font>

319
00:20:24,310 --> 00:20:27,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So there are creatures
like that all over the place?</b></font>

320
00:20:27,310 --> 00:20:28,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This will be tricky.</b></font>

321
00:20:28,980 --> 00:20:30,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't know, Frieren.</b></font>

322
00:20:30,310 --> 00:20:31,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Mm?</b></font>

323
00:20:31,980 --> 00:20:33,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The price was steep
to travel by sea,</b></font>

324
00:20:33,900 --> 00:20:35,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but compared to this,</b></font>

325
00:20:36,070 --> 00:20:38,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the hit to our purses
would've been worth it.</b></font>

326
00:20:40,950 --> 00:20:42,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren chuckles softly]</b></font>

327
00:20:44,450 --> 00:20:48,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[EISEN] I didn't expect to find
such a powerful monster here.</b></font>

328
00:20:48,830 --> 00:20:51,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was certain
we were going to die.</b></font>

329
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:53,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We should've sailed
past this region</b></font>

330
00:20:53,590 --> 00:20:55,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if the road ahead is going
to remain as dangerous.</b></font>

331
00:20:56,380 --> 00:20:58,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It will be dangerous.</b></font>

332
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:01,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why I chose it.</b></font>

333
00:21:01,140 --> 00:21:03,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Many people live here,
you know.</b></font>

334
00:21:05,220 --> 00:21:06,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The reason
that I became a hero</b></font>

335
00:21:06,890 --> 00:21:09,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was because I wanted
to protect my homeland.</b></font>

336
00:21:10,230 --> 00:21:13,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And now I want to protect
other people's homes, too.</b></font>

337
00:21:14,520 --> 00:21:16,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Listen, Stark,</b></font>

338
00:21:16,730 --> 00:21:18,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>dangerous as it is,</b></font>

339
00:21:18,110 --> 00:21:20,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there are many who call
this plateau their home.</b></font>

340
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:21,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Huh?</b></font>

341
00:21:27,790 --> 00:21:29,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

342
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:38,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't think
about it like that.</b></font>

343
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'll fight for them.</b></font>

344
00:21:40,510 --> 00:21:43,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes. That is our battle cry.</b></font>

345
00:21:43,180 --> 00:21:44,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right.</b></font>

346
00:21:45,430 --> 00:21:47,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks to Stark's reckless
abandon,</b></font>

347
00:21:47,390 --> 00:21:49,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we scrounged out a victory.</b></font>

348
00:21:49,430 --> 00:21:51,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If we want to succeed
going forward,</b></font>

349
00:21:51,140 --> 00:21:53,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we'll have to focus
on increasing our teamwork.</b></font>

350
00:21:54,350 --> 00:21:55,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] I agree.</b></font>

351
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:58,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Stop relaxing, teammate.</b></font>

352
00:21:58,990 --> 00:22:00,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We still have much work to do.</b></font>

353
00:22:02,030 --> 00:22:04,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's bold of you to assume
I'm relaxing.</b></font>

354
00:22:05,120 --> 00:22:06,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOTH] Hm?</b></font>

355
00:22:06,700 --> 00:22:09,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As always, my legs gave out.</b></font>

356
00:22:09,870 --> 00:22:12,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern sighs] Pathetic.</b></font>

357
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:14,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It isn't like
I wanted them to!</b></font>

358
00:22:15,420 --> 00:22:17,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That crazy spell
could've fried me!</b></font>

359
00:22:17,210 --> 00:22:18,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was nearly a pile of ash!</b></font>

360
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:19,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern chuckles]</b></font>

361
00:22:19,800 --> 00:22:22,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

362
00:23:50,220 --> 00:23:52,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Don't come
crying to me later.</b></font>

363
00:23:52,220 --> 00:23:54,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Seriously,
what are we going to do?</b></font>

364
00:23:54,140 --> 00:23:55,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] Let go already!</b></font>

365
00:23:55,350 --> 00:23:56,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MINER] The president
told us about you.</b></font>

366
00:23:56,890 --> 00:23:57,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HEITER] But of course.</b></font>

367
00:23:58,190 --> 00:23:59,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NORM] " Logistics
in the Northern Plateau."</b></font>

